            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Pharmaceutical formulations of cannabinoids, in particular of cannabidiol, are provided. The formulations are in the form of a solid dispersion, wherein the solid dispersion comprises in admixture a cannabinoid, an amphiphilic block copolymer as a solubilizer, a water-soluble film former and an antioxidant.</p>
